  "ingredients": [
    "2 cups all-purpose flour",
    "2 teaspoons baking soda",
    "1 teaspoon salt",
    "2 cups white sugar",
    "1 cup butter, softened",
    "2 cups mashed overripe bananas",
    "4 large eggs, beaten",
    "1 cup chopped walnuts"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Grease and flour two 9x5-inch loaf pans.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/HVRl_X1L3OGnlwyr4zNcT37HOcM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/67937-extreme-banana-nut-bread-PICS-step-01-a5108c43ae1d4789b8e4fd28e0d9292c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/67937/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sift flour, baking soda, and salt into a large bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/bYOavsSBddiQgymSVXzTB_OAAec=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/67937-extreme-banana-nut-bread-PICS-step-02-93ef2a00364a41bd9a5be4feadc4a8f7.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/67937/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cream sugar and butter together in a separate bowl. Stir in bananas, eggs, and walnuts until well blended.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/qDsgH0fmt4gDxndK-NQfTXVW7WI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/67937-extreme-banana-nut-bread-PICS-step-03-a68596278c9044a1a308b197878425eb.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/67937/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour wet ingredients into flour mixture and stir just until blended.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/xYaY3hKJ95Cl2eypsS62wFbLs9s=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/67937-extreme-banana-nut-bread-PICS-step-04-936a020d3d104b12a7cd95591b58cb62.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/67937/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Divide the batter evenly between the two prepared pans.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/4k9UX5St2-j4sV0wfyygTRwwxfs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/67937-extreme-banana-nut-bread-PICS-step-05-4f707ca8889a4ed2a4f1311bda8c6d79.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/67937/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until a paring knife inserted into the crown of each loaf comes out clean, 60 to 70 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/GGmTMjvfS927AO_XgIUi4dIXYEc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/67937-extreme-banana-nut-bread-PICS-step-06-b6cacc99e0f44496bf9000e32f26c872.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/67937/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove from the oven and let loaves cool in the pans for at least 5 minutes. Turn out onto a cooling rack, and let cool completely, about 30 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/XxgeYcwqNJnE0B6Ju-Gp033a21A=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/67937-extreme-banana-nut-bread-PICS-step-07-fc4ac90d9071418c979edf54e4a326c0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/67937/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Slice and serve. For more intense flavor, wrap each loaf in aluminum foil to keep in the moisture, then refrigerate for at least 2 hours before serving.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/2_Q9nlzNVbk9nbMF4XsFmmw8ku8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/67937-extreme-banana-nut-bread-PICS-Beauty-4x3-5b7d1c025a874cc0816e62657f8ca507.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/67937/step_08.webp"
    }
